                "- baimbwa haba: wako natafuta uzima wangu nisitiriwe mwilini.",
                "- mapepo haya: wako natafuta uzima wangu nisitiriwe mwilini."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "Nikitazama humo duniani uovu unizunguruka mitego na nyavu utandikwa mu njia yangu ni fanye je mimi munaziri wa mungu haya ni mateso."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "source_block",
              "lines": [
                "Nialike nani ulimwengu humo nzige na nge unipiganisha mafalme za giza ushambulia njia yangu Roho na moyo ufazaika ndani yangu haya ni mateso"
              ]
            }
